1305
01:28:22,902 --> 01:28:25,863
<i>Supermen!
Mums tevi steidzami vajag Metropolē.</i>

1306
01:28:25,864 --> 01:28:27,322
Man jādodas uz Borāviju, Terifik.

1307
01:28:27,323 --> 01:28:29,658
Nebūs ne Borāvijas, ne Metropoles,

1308
01:28:29,659 --> 01:28:31,953
